{"key":"c0a24fafa9f07782","source_file":"Potts O.json","source_id":19625,"source_url":"concordance-only-begotten-ppl-unigenitus","term":"Only-begotten","headwords":["Only-begotten"],"latin":["Unigenitus"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Only-begotten"],"latin":["Unigenitus"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AE","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"2628","subsection":"2"},"text":"The Lord as to the Divine Human is called... the only-begotten. Illustrated. AC 2827:end.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6716","subsection":"3"},"text":"For He was His only-begotten Son.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"8127","subsection":"2"},"text":"By the only-begotten Son () is meant the Lord as to the Divine truth.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"26","subsection":null},"text":"The Son born of God through the Virgin Mary in time is the Only Son of God, and the only-begotten.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"5841","subsection":null},"text":"The Bull Unigenitus. SE 5844:3. LJPost 103. LJPost 104.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"637","subsection":"9"},"text":"Make to thee the mourning of an only-begotten (). Explained.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"only-begotten","url":"/meta/potts/only-begotten/"}